# FBA Operator Lab — environment shell
#
# This project runs in DEMO / PREVIEW MODE with no values set below.
# In demo mode, sign-in/sign-up/reset forms render fully but do not create a
# real session — the UI clearly labels this so nobody mistakes it for live auth.
#
# To enable real Supabase auth + progress storage, create a free Supabase
# project (https://supabase.com — free tier), then copy this file to `.env`
# and fill in the two public values below. Never commit `.env` or any real
# key to source control.
#
# PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL and PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY are safe to expose to the
# browser by design (Supabase's anon/public key + Row Level Security is the
# standard client-side auth model) — do NOT put a service_role key here or
# in any client-side code.

PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
